fornia/san-joaquin-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 47 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 30% of normal in April to May and 208% in September to October. Grid 20735 had its driest year in 2013 at 26% of normal.</p>"}
